  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 802.06 “Critical habitat” means habitat of endangered or threatened species of wildlife designated by the executive director of the New Hampshire fish and game department as critical in accordance with to RSA 212-A:9, III.\n\nSource. #14374, INTERIM, eff 8-26-25; ss by #14473 (formerly Env-C 802.04), eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES 1-19-36",
